From: Ross Lagerwall <ross.lagerwall@citrix.com>
Subject: Stash a copy of the public headers used by the dom0 kernel

The hypercall filtering code in the dom0 kernel uses a copy of the
public headers. Any changes to the headers might mean that the filter
code needs to be updated. Stash a copy of the public headers and check
during the build if the public headers have changed.

If the build fails due to a public header change, update the hypercall
filter code in the dom0 kernel as needed to adjust for the public header
changes then copy xen/include/public to public-abi and refresh this
patch.

Signed-off-by: Ross Lagerwall <ross.lagerwall@citrix.com>
