+/*
+ * Request buffer response - response for XENCAMERA_OP_BUF_REQUEST
+ * request:
+ *         0                1                 2               3        octet
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |               id                |_OP_BUF_REQUEST |    reserved    | 4
