+ *
+ *
+ * Control enumerate response - response for XENCAMERA_OP_CTRL_ENUM:
+ *         0                1                 2               3        octet
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |               id                | _OP_CTRL_ENUM  |    reserved    | 4
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
