+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                          min high 32-bits                         | 24
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                          max low 32-bits                          | 28
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                          max high 32-bits                         | 32
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                         step low 32-bits                          | 36
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                         step high 32-bits                         | 40
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                        def_val low 32-bits                        | 44
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                        def_val high 32-bits                       | 48
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                             reserved                              | 52
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/|
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
+ * |                             reserved                              | 64
+ * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
